GGCAT v2.2.0's fix of an unsigned underflow in eulertigs part 3, from its pull request 79 (unmerged as of
2026-10-26): https://github.com/algbio/ggcat/pull/79. Without it, --eulertigs intermittently aborts with a
~2^62-byte allocation.

